1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 27]</font>

15
00:01:18,220 --> 00:01:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty wants to see my brother,</font>

16
00:01:20,100 --> 00:01:21,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he sent Duke Dingguo to fetch him.</font>

17
00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:23,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did Duke Dingguo tell His Majesty</font>

18
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about what Mobai did to Jiang Ying?</font>

19
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo is second only
to the Emperor.</font>

20
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you ever seen him</font>

21
00:01:28,980 --> 00:01:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">be so respectful</font>

22
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to anyone?</font>

23
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then he's very pleased with my brother?</font>

24
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My heart is in turmoil.</font>

25
00:01:44,380 --> 00:01:44,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

26
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've come to take you home.</font>

27
00:01:47,160 --> 00:01:48,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Qin holds a special status.</font>

28
00:01:49,260 --> 00:01:51,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To ensure his personal safety,</font>

29
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:53,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have specially invited him</font>

30
00:01:53,260 --> 00:01:54,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to stay at my residence temporarily.</font>

31
00:01:55,460 --> 00:01:56,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must trouble you</font>

32
00:01:56,700 --> 00:01:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not to disturb this esteemed guest.</font>

33
00:01:58,440 --> 00:01:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go back now.</font>

34
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:00,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Esteemed guest?</font>

35
00:02:00,940 --> 00:02:02,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What esteemed guest?</font>

36
00:02:02,620 --> 00:02:03,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is my brother!</font>

37
00:02:04,340 --> 00:02:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is your brother</font>

38
00:02:06,340 --> 00:02:07,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and also a prince of Xizhao.</font>

39
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wish to speak with my sister alone.</font>

40
00:02:14,340 --> 00:02:15,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please grant us this moment.</font>

41
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

42
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

43
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:33,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you suddenly become
a prince of Xizhao?</font>

44
00:02:34,420 --> 00:02:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a long story.</font>

45
00:02:35,780 --> 00:02:36,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only found out today</font>

46
00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:37,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when I entered the Palace.</font>

47
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:39,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They plan to send me back</font>

48
00:02:39,820 --> 00:02:40,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to Xizhao soon.</font>

49
00:02:41,420 --> 00:02:42,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xizhao is in turmoil.</font>

50
00:02:43,180 --> 00:02:44,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Three princes died in quick succession.</font>

51
00:02:46,140 --> 00:02:47,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are the sole surviving prince.</font>

52
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are very likely</font>

53
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to become Xizhao's future ruler.</font>

54
00:02:51,700 --> 00:02:53,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your presence is a lifeline</font>

55
00:02:53,420 --> 00:02:54,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for Xizhao.</font>

56
00:02:55,460 --> 00:02:56,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They will never let you go.</font>

57
00:02:57,420 --> 00:02:58,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll hide as long as I can.</font>

58
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do not wish to spend</font>

59
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:02,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the rest of my life as anyone's puppet.</font>

60
00:03:03,500 --> 00:03:04,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

61
00:03:06,780 --> 00:03:07,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me help you.</font>

62
00:03:09,620 --> 00:03:10,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Qin.</font>

63
00:03:11,540 --> 00:03:12,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's getting late.</font>

64
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We should go.</font>

65
00:03:24,660 --> 00:03:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did it suddenly come to this?</font>

66
00:03:30,220 --> 00:03:31,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There must be a way to fix this.</font>

67
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

68
00:03:37,780 --> 00:03:38,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, come on.</font>

69
00:03:38,740 --> 00:03:39,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit.</font>

70
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying, what are you up to now?</font>

71
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw</font>

72
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've been so heartbroken lately.</font>

73
00:03:47,180 --> 00:03:47,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just look.</font>

74
00:03:48,380 --> 00:03:50,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your head's practically shrunk
from worry.</font>

75
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

76
00:03:51,820 --> 00:03:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I made a special effort</font>

77
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to prepare this whole table of dishes</font>

78
00:03:54,260 --> 00:03:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to cheer you up.</font>

79
00:03:57,420 --> 00:03:58,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mostly because</font>

80
00:03:58,800 --> 00:03:59,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't resist</font>

81
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:02,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai's persistence.</font>

82
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:03,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

83
00:04:03,580 --> 00:04:04,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

84
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:05,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">reluctantly agreed.</font>

85
00:04:06,420 --> 00:04:07,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just think.</font>

86
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:08,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,</font>

87
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:10,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it'll just be you and Father
in this house.</font>

88
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two rough men fending for yourselves.</font>

89
00:04:13,020 --> 00:04:15,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you want to taste my cooking again,</font>

90
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it won't be so easy.</font>

91
00:04:17,380 --> 00:04:17,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

92
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:19,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">today,</font>

93
00:04:19,380 --> 00:04:20,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just loosen your belt and eat.</font>

94
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat your fill.</font>

95
00:04:22,140 --> 00:04:23,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This whole table is all yours.</font>

96
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one's fighting you for it.</font>

97
00:04:26,100 --> 00:04:26,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying,</font>

98
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you want to gloat,
no need for all this fuss.</font>

99
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These dishes aren't necessary.</font>

100
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:35,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After the storm,</font>

101
00:04:35,580 --> 00:04:38,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the moon shines bright.</font>

102
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:40,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not only is the moon bright,</font>

103
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but its light has reached our home.</font>

104
00:04:43,700 --> 00:04:44,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

105
00:04:44,620 --> 00:04:45,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father has brought your moon</font>

106
00:04:46,020 --> 00:04:46,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">back home.</font>

107
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:48,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's in the front hall.</font>

108
00:04:49,420 --> 00:04:49,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it true?</font>

109
00:04:50,900 --> 00:04:52,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, I'm coming!</font>

110
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:57,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai!</font>

111
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:01,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai!</font>

112
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:04,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai!</font>

113
00:05:04,380 --> 00:05:06,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you come to propose to me?</font>

114
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:07,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady,</font>

115
00:05:07,780 --> 00:05:08,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Duke has ordered us</font>

116
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:10,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to escort Mr. Qin to the west chamber.</font>

117
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may leave us.</font>

118
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:13,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take him there later.</font>

119
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:15,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Off you go, now.</font>

120
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

121
00:05:19,840 --> 00:05:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

122
00:05:21,460 --> 00:05:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was just thinking of you,</font>

123
00:05:22,940 --> 00:05:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and here you are.</font>

124
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Jiang,</font>

125
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:27,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear I cannot fulfill</font>

126
00:05:29,100 --> 00:05:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what I promised you.</font>

127
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:32,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

128
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Very soon,</font>

129
00:05:34,900 --> 00:05:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must leave this place.</font>

130
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you not promise to marry me?</font>

131
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or have you changed your mind?</font>

132
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because your happiness</font>

133
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:45,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">matters more than a promise.</font>

134
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can give you nothing.</font>

135
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I ask for nothing.</font>

136
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:52,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only wish to be with you.</font>

137
00:05:56,500 --> 00:05:57,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Jiang,</font>

138
00:05:58,440 --> 00:05:59,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no one can truly ask for nothing.</font>

139
00:06:00,660 --> 00:06:01,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your family,</font>

140
00:06:01,940 --> 00:06:02,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your friends,</font>

141
00:06:03,460 --> 00:06:04,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the place where you grew up.</font>

142
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These are things
you can't bear to leave.</font>

143
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

144
00:06:12,900 --> 00:06:13,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't understand.</font>

145
00:06:14,580 --> 00:06:16,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has something happened?</font>

146
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:19,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My father forced you, didn't he?</font>

147
00:06:20,100 --> 00:06:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come.</font>

148
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:21,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take you to clear the air with him.</font>

149
00:06:21,940 --> 00:06:22,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Clear the air about what?</font>

150
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father,</font>

151
00:06:23,900 --> 00:06:24,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai and I...</font>

152
00:06:24,340 --> 00:06:24,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Silence.</font>

153
00:06:27,780 --> 00:06:29,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Clinging to a man in broad daylight,</font>

154
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:30,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have you no shame?</font>

155
00:06:31,260 --> 00:06:32,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's not just any man.</font>

156
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:33,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's the one I love.</font>

157
00:06:34,260 --> 00:06:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go of him.</font>

158
00:06:35,060 --> 00:06:35,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't.</font>

159
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have already been intimate.</font>

160
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Jiang speaks in anger.</font>

161
00:06:44,420 --> 00:06:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There is nothing between us.</font>

162
00:06:46,020 --> 00:06:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have done nothing improper.</font>

163
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father,</font>

164
00:06:49,220 --> 00:06:50,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we are family here.</font>

165
00:06:50,140 --> 00:06:50,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's talk this through.</font>

166
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What family?</font>

167
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father,</font>

168
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">didn't you once say</font>

169
00:06:56,140 --> 00:06:57,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you would accept</font>

170
00:06:57,700 --> 00:06:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whoever I set my heart on?</font>

171
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:01,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why does that no longer hold true?</font>

172
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyone but him.</font>

173
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:05,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

174
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am a prince of Xizhao.</font>

175
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Jiang.</font>

176
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should not waste
your affections on me.</font>

177
00:07:23,300 --> 00:07:23,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

178
00:07:24,100 --> 00:07:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father, let me out!</font>

179
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father, let me out!</font>

180
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:29,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep a close watch on her these days.</font>

181
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:30,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not let her out.</font>

182
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

183
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:32,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me out!</font>

184
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master.</font>

185
00:07:34,060 --> 00:07:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Knowing the lady's temperament,</font>

186
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:36,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the more we try to stop her,</font>

187
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:37,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the more she'll fixate on him.</font>

188
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we send the Xizhao prince away soon,</font>

189
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:41,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it will break her obsession sooner.</font>

190
00:07:42,700 --> 00:07:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To avoid further complications,</font>

191
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:46,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">escort Qin Mobai out asap.</font>

192
00:07:47,140 --> 00:07:48,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, Master.</font>

193
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me out, Father!</font>

194
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me out!</font>

195
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:02,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

196
00:08:02,660 --> 00:08:03,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is my brother?</font>

197
00:08:04,460 --> 00:08:06,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo is sending him
to Xizhao tonight.</font>

198
00:08:07,540 --> 00:08:08,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do we do?</font>

199
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have men following them.</font>

200
00:08:10,220 --> 00:08:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They will report
his whereabouts regularly.</font>

201
00:08:13,820 --> 00:08:14,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

202
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are we taking this narrow path</font>

203
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">instead of the main road?</font>

204
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How should I know?</font>

205
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We follow orders from above.</font>

206
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:26,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat up. Quickly.</font>

207
00:08:26,860 --> 00:08:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop your yapping.</font>

208
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But this is Yunshan Road.</font>

209
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's easy to run into bandits here.</font>

210
00:08:33,260 --> 00:08:33,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bandits!</font>

211
00:08:34,820 --> 00:08:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ignoring the safe main road,</font>

212
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you dare trespass on my Yunshan Road.</font>

213
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems to me</font>

214
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have no respect for Yun Banshan.</font>

215
00:08:41,180 --> 00:08:42,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where did you come from?</font>

216
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare you block Duke Dingguo's road?</font>

217
00:08:44,340 --> 00:08:45,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who gave you the nerve?</font>

218
00:08:46,100 --> 00:08:48,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In our trade,
we only know money, not faces.</font>

219
00:08:49,580 --> 00:08:50,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you know what's good for you,</font>

220
00:08:50,540 --> 00:08:51,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">leave all your belongings behind.</font>

221
00:08:52,180 --> 00:08:53,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And we'll spare your worthless lives.</font>

222
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:56,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about this?</font>

223
00:08:57,300 --> 00:08:58,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take all the money and goods,</font>

224
00:08:58,700 --> 00:08:59,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but this carriage</font>

225
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:00,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">stays with us.</font>

226
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Except for you government soldiers,</font>

227
00:09:03,220 --> 00:09:04,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everyone else must remain.</font>

228
00:09:04,580 --> 00:09:05,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise,</font>

229
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't blame us if blood is shed.</font>

230
00:09:07,620 --> 00:09:09,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just don't know when to quit.</font>

231
00:09:09,620 --> 00:09:10,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Attack!</font>

232
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some greenwood heroes you are,</font>

233
00:09:17,500 --> 00:09:18,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">using dirty tricks.</font>

234
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:27,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai!</font>

235
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

236
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you alright?</font>

237
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You scoundrel!</font>

238
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare you harm my beloved?</font>

239
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go to hell!</font>

240
00:09:46,620 --> 00:09:47,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying?</font>

241
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying?</font>

242
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:49,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's she doing here?</font>

243
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

244
00:09:57,880 --> 00:09:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're finally awake.</font>

245
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun, what are you doing here?</font>

246
00:10:04,800 --> 00:10:05,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you alright?</font>

247
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you all here?</font>

248
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought</font>

249
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:11,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was catching bandits.</font>

250
00:10:11,820 --> 00:10:13,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some scoundrel used a dirty trick</font>

251
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and hit me.</font>

252
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My head is splitting with pain.</font>

253
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's talking about you.</font>

254
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were too tough.</font>

255
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:22,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was just trying
to protect your sister.</font>

256
00:10:23,920 --> 00:10:24,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well.</font>

257
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:26,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief said you were confined
to quarters.</font>

258
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you get out?</font>

259
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I convinced my brother,</font>

260
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:33,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so he let me go.</font>

261
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:35,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Chief still cares for you.</font>

262
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As a girl, you came here alone.</font>

263
00:10:38,580 --> 00:10:40,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you afraid of danger?</font>

264
00:10:40,460 --> 00:10:41,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all.</font>

265
00:10:41,680 --> 00:10:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm your sister-in-law, after all.</font>

266
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be wherever your brother is.</font>

267
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying.</font>

268
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to speak with you.</font>

269
00:10:56,300 --> 00:10:56,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come.</font>

270
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought</font>

271
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:04,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had made myself perfectly clear.</font>

272
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:06,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You shouldn't have done this.</font>

273
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:10,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I've already done it.</font>

274
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:13,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you make me leave now,</font>

275
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my brother said he'd beat me to death.</font>

276
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Following me will bring you
much hardship.</font>

277
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll be like drifting duckweed.</font>

278
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Doesn't that frighten you?</font>

279
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not afraid.</font>

280
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

281
00:11:28,380 --> 00:11:29,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you afraid?</font>

282
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't ever be so reckless again.</font>

283
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You had me worried sick.</font>

284
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:43,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I promise.</font>

285
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:01,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A true hermit hides in plain sight.</font>

286
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:03,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've dressed like this.</font>

287
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who could possibly recognize you
in a crowd?</font>

288
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:07,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not that simple, Jun.</font>

289
00:12:08,140 --> 00:12:10,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To be honest, I am a bit worried.</font>

290
00:12:10,580 --> 00:12:11,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My noble bearing</font>

291
00:12:12,140 --> 00:12:13,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is rather hard to conceal.</font>

292
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then your worry is a bit unnecessary.</font>

293
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll stay at the inn
these next few days.</font>

294
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:21,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once the heat dies down,
we'll return to Guanzhou.</font>

295
00:12:21,560 --> 00:12:22,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

296
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince and I will head back first.</font>

297
00:12:24,420 --> 00:12:25,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, it might raise suspicion.</font>

298
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:27,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll meet you in Guanzhou later.</font>

299
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be very careful then.</font>

300
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:31,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

301
00:12:31,420 --> 00:12:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest assured.</font>

302
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will take good care of your brother.</font>

303
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Ying.</font>

304
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will miss you too.</font>

305
00:12:41,420 --> 00:12:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

306
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait for us.</font>

307
00:12:44,880 --> 00:12:45,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll be back soon.</font>

308
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:47,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay safe.</font>

309
00:12:47,580 --> 00:12:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You too.</font>

310
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:03,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao has repeatedly betrayed me</font>

311
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:05,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the sake of the Qin siblings.</font>

312
00:13:05,920 --> 00:13:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is he?</font>

313
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:07,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Summon him here.</font>

314
00:13:08,180 --> 00:13:09,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty, please calm your anger.</font>

315
00:13:10,660 --> 00:13:11,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right now</font>

316
00:13:11,580 --> 00:13:13,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not the time to settle scores
with Prince Duan.</font>

317
00:13:14,060 --> 00:13:14,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The most urgent matter</font>

318
00:13:14,820 --> 00:13:16,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is to appease Qin Mobai</font>

319
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and make him willingly return to Xizhao.</font>

320
00:13:18,980 --> 00:13:19,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only in this way</font>

321
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can our plan stay intact.</font>

322
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your foresight is truly profound.</font>

323
00:13:32,300 --> 00:13:33,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But after this matter...</font>

324
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:39,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

325
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:41,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

326
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:43,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Time to eat!</font>

327
00:13:47,260 --> 00:13:48,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened to your face?</font>

328
00:13:50,700 --> 00:13:51,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nothing.</font>

329
00:13:51,880 --> 00:13:53,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just now,</font>

330
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I accidentally used flour</font>

331
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">instead of wood shavings.</font>

332
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A new kitchen takes
some getting used to.</font>

333
00:13:59,920 --> 00:14:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is an inn.</font>

334
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why must you cook yourself?</font>

335
00:14:03,540 --> 00:14:04,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

336
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could you forget your birthday?</font>

337
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good thing Jun reminded me yesterday.</font>

338
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's a little heart.</font>

339
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:12,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei is so thoughtful.</font>

340
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:15,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, do you know?</font>

341
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:17,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every year on my birthday,</font>

342
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my father</font>

343
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would make me longevity noodles.</font>

344
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said it would bring</font>

345
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:23,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a smooth year ahead.</font>

346
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

347
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I made a bowl for you as well.</font>

348
00:14:27,400 --> 00:14:28,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat it while it's hot.</font>

349
00:14:34,780 --> 00:14:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

350
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:37,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you cook often?</font>

351
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:40,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mother loved cooking.</font>

352
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:41,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She always said</font>

353
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:44,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she'd make delicious meals
for my father forever.</font>

354
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But she passed away
when I was very young.</font>

355
00:14:51,340 --> 00:14:53,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone says my cooking is awful.</font>

356
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:56,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you find it unappetizing,</font>

357
00:14:56,660 --> 00:14:58,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can make you a more presentable dish.</font>

358
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it really that bad?</font>

359
00:15:16,780 --> 00:15:17,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd say</font>

360
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's quite skillfully made.</font>

361
00:15:20,300 --> 00:15:21,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, you have fine taste.</font>

362
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:23,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then have some more.</font>

363
00:15:24,660 --> 00:15:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me hold your hair up.</font>

364
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:30,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The vegetables are very fresh today.</font>

365
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:31,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take some home.</font>

366
00:15:31,500 --> 00:15:32,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Gao, you've come to the city!</font>

367
00:15:32,920 --> 00:15:33,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

368
00:15:33,460 --> 00:15:34,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come pick out some vegetables.</font>

369
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:35,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're very fresh today.</font>

370
00:15:35,740 --> 00:15:36,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've heard</font>

371
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:37,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there are wild rumors spreading</font>

372
00:15:38,060 --> 00:15:39,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Duke Dingguo is critically ill.</font>

373
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:39,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

374
00:15:40,020 --> 00:15:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They say he failed in his duties,</font>

375
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:42,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so His Majesty punished him in anger,</font>

376
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:44,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">which aggravated his old ailment.</font>

377
00:15:45,140 --> 00:15:45,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wasn't he the one</font>

378
00:15:45,820 --> 00:15:47,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who helped our Emperor rise to power?</font>

379
00:15:48,060 --> 00:15:49,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What grave mistake could he have made</font>

380
00:15:49,940 --> 00:15:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to be treated this way?</font>

381
00:15:50,900 --> 00:15:51,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

382
00:16:00,220 --> 00:16:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

383
00:16:04,340 --> 00:16:05,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you hear the rumors</font>

384
00:16:06,020 --> 00:16:07,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about your father?</font>

385
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My father's health has always been poor.</font>

386
00:16:12,880 --> 00:16:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid something
might happen to him.</font>

387
00:16:15,540 --> 00:16:16,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, in your heart,</font>

388
00:16:16,820 --> 00:16:17,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've already decided, haven't you?</font>

389
00:16:19,940 --> 00:16:21,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter what, I must go back.</font>

390
00:16:22,300 --> 00:16:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if it's just a glimpse in secret,</font>

391
00:16:24,140 --> 00:16:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to know he's safe.</font>

392
00:16:26,260 --> 00:16:26,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go with you.</font>

393
00:16:27,340 --> 00:16:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, Mobai.</font>

394
00:16:28,940 --> 00:16:30,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you go,</font>

395
00:16:30,300 --> 00:16:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear they'll capture you again</font>

396
00:16:32,340 --> 00:16:33,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and send you back to Xizhao</font>

397
00:16:33,500 --> 00:16:34,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to live a life you despise.</font>

398
00:16:37,260 --> 00:16:38,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if you go alone,</font>

399
00:16:38,140 --> 00:16:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't stop worrying.</font>

400
00:16:43,160 --> 00:16:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, don't worry.</font>

401
00:16:45,220 --> 00:16:46,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go back and check on Father.</font>

402
00:16:46,800 --> 00:16:47,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he's all right,</font>

403
00:16:48,060 --> 00:16:49,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll come straight back to find you.</font>

404
00:16:54,520 --> 00:16:55,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

405
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:57,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please don't worry anymore.</font>

406
00:16:57,520 --> 00:16:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If anything happens on my end,</font>

407
00:17:00,060 --> 00:17:02,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have Jun send word to you, okay?</font>

408
00:17:04,660 --> 00:17:05,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

409
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:15,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

410
00:17:16,750 --> 00:17:18,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

411
00:17:18,420 --> 00:17:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

412
00:17:22,340 --> 00:17:26,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

413
00:17:27,020 --> 00:17:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

414
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

415
00:17:35,530 --> 00:17:39,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

416
00:17:39,860 --> 00:17:45,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

417
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:52,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

418
00:17:52,670 --> 00:17:56,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

419
00:17:56,720 --> 00:18:01,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

420
00:18:01,260 --> 00:18:04,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

421
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:09,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

422
00:18:09,840 --> 00:18:13,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
